# 📐 SIDUL Design System

**Sistem Informasi Magang Digital (SIDUL)**
*Dokumen Referensi Desain & Arsitektur — Tugas Akhir*

---

## 1. Stack Teknologi

| Layer | Teknologi | Versi |
|---|---|---|
| Backend Framework | Laravel | 12.x |
| PHP | PHP | 8.3.x |
| CSS Framework | Tailwind CSS | v4 (`@import 'tailwindcss'`) |
| UI Component Library | DaisyUI | Plugin Tailwind |
| Font | Instrument Sans | Google Fonts |
| Build Tool | Vite | - |
| Database | MySQL | - |

---

## 2. Tipografi

### Font Family

```
Font: Instrument Sans (Google Fonts)
CSS Variable: --font-sans: 'Instrument Sans', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif
Tailwind Class: font-sans (default body via layouts/app.blade.php)
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Aturan Wajib:** Setiap wrapper konten HARUS memiliki class `font-sans` secara eksplisit, terutama di dalam komponen DaisyUI (`table`, `card`) yang tidak otomatis inherit font dari body. Contoh: `<div class="... font-sans">`.

### Skala Ketebalan Font

| Kelas | Nilai CSS | Penggunaan |
|---|---|---|
| `font-black` | 900 | Angka statistik, nama mahasiswa, judul kartu, tombol aksi |
| `font-extrabold` | 800 | Judul section, heading level 2 |
| `font-bold` | 700 | Deskripsi header, menu sidebar aktif |
| `font-semibold` | 600 | Menu sidebar non-aktif |
| `font-medium` | 500 | Teks paragraf, deskripsi |

### Skala Ukuran Teks

| Kelas | Penggunaan |
|---|---|
| `text-4xl` | Angka utama di stat card |
| `text-2xl` / `text-3xl` | H2 heading utama halaman (di header banner) |
| `text-xl` | H3 heading sub-section |
| `text-sm` | Teks isi tabel, nama pengguna |
| `text-xs` | Label badge, keterangan tanggal |
| `text-[11px]` | Sub-label (NIM, program studi) |
| `text-[10px]` | Label kolom tabel, menu title sidebar |
| `text-[9px]` / `text-[8px]` | Teks di dalam badge kecil |

---

## 3. Palet Warna

### Brand Colors (dari `resources/css/app.css`)

```css
--color-primary:   #6B21A8;   /* Ungu Utama */
--color-secondary: #F49E0A;   /* Oranye Warning */
--color-base-100:  #F9FAFB;   /* Background Halaman */
```

### Palet Lengkap

| Nama | Hex | Tailwind Class | Penggunaan |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Primary Purple** | `#6B21A8` | `bg-[#6B21A8]`, `text-[#6B21A8]` | Header, tombol utama, angka stat wali |
| **Warning Orange** | `#F49E0A` | `text-[#F49E0A]` | Badge pending, angka stat pending |
| **Success Green** | `green-600` | `text-green-600`, `bg-green-50` | Angka stat selesai, badge disetujui |
| **Page Background** | `#F9FAFB` | `bg-[#F9FAFB]` | Latar seluruh halaman |
| **Card Background** | `#FFFFFF` | `bg-white` | Semua card / panel |
| **Border Default** | `gray-100` | `border-gray-100` | Border card, separator |
| **Text Utama** | `gray-900` | `text-gray-900` | Nama, judul penting |
| **Text Sekunder** | `gray-400` | `text-gray-400` | NIM, keterangan, label kolom |

### Warna Avatar per Role (ui-avatars.com)

| Role | Warna | Parameter URL |
|---|---|---|
| Mahasiswa | Ungu | `background=6B21A8&color=fff` |
| Dosen | Oranye | `background=F49E0A&color=fff` |
| Operator | Biru | `background=2563EB&color=fff` |

