## 4. Komponen UI

### 4.1 Header Halaman — Glassmorphism (STANDAR SEMUA HALAMAN)

```html
<div class="bg-[#6B21A8] text-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2rem] relative overflow-hidden border-none shadow-2xl mt-2">
    <!-- Dekorasi blur -->
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-64 h-64 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -left-20 -bottom-20 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between relative z-10">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black mb-2">Judul Halaman 👋</h2>
            <p class="text-white/90 font-medium text-sm">Deskripsi singkat halaman.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Badge status (opsional) -->
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 flex items-center gap-3 shadow-xl">
            <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(74,222,128,0.8)]"></div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Label Status</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

### 4.2 Stat Card (Kartu Statistik Dashboard)

```html
<div class="card bg-white shadow-sm border border-base-200">
    <div class="card-body p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">LABEL STAT</p>
                <h3 class="text-4xl font-black text-[#6B21A8]">{{ $nilai }}</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 text-[#6B21A8]">
                <!-- SVG Icon h-8 w-8 -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

**Warna angka per jenis statistik:**
- Total data wali → `text-[#6B21A8]` (ungu)
- Pending / butuh aksi → `text-[#F49E0A]` (oranye)
- Selesai / lulus → `text-green-600` (hijau)

### 4.3 Badge Status

```html
<!-- Pending / Warning -->
<span class="inline-block text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-orange-50 text-[#F49E0A]">Pending</span>

<!-- Approved / Success -->
<span class="inline-block text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-green-50 text-green-600">Disetujui</span>

<!-- Active / Info -->
<span class="inline-block text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-purple-50 text-[#6B21A8]">Aktif</span>
```

### 4.4 Tombol Aksi

```html
<!-- Tombol Utama (Approve / Submit) -->
<button class="btn rounded-xl bg-[#6B21A8] hover:bg-purple-800 border-none text-white font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">
    Approve
</button>

<!-- Tombol Sekunder (Revisi / Batal) -->
<button class="btn rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">
    Revisi
</button>

<!-- Tombol Ghost (Unduh / Tutup) -->
<button class="btn rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-500 hover:text-[#6B21A8] hover:bg-purple-50 hover:border-purple-100 font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider transition-all">
    Unduh PDF
</button>
```

### 4.5 Baris Data (Grid Div — menggantikan `<table>`)

> [!NOTE]
> Pattern `div` grid digunakan **sebagai pengganti** elemen `<table>` DaisyUI karena `<table>` tidak meng-inherit `font-family` dari body, menyebabkan font bukan Instrument Sans.

```html
<div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] border border-gray-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden font-sans">
    <!-- Header kolom -->
    <div class="px-8 py-3 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 border-b border-gray-100">
        <div class="col-span-5 text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Kolom 1</div>
        <div class="col-span-4 text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Kolom 2</div>
        <div class="col-span-3 text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-right">Aksi</div>
    </div>
    <!-- Baris data -->
    <div class="px-8 py-5 grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-center hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-all border-b border-gray-100 group">
        <!-- isi setiap kolom -->
    </div>
</div>
```

### 4.6 Avatar Mahasiswa (Inisial Teks)

```html
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 text-[#6B21A8] flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg group-hover:rotate-3 transition-transform">
    {{ substr($nama, 0, 2) }}
</div>
```

### 4.7 Menu Item Sidebar — State Active vs Tidak Aktif

```html
<!-- AKTIF -->
<a class="active bg-[#6B21A8] text-white rounded-xl py-3 px-4 font-bold shadow-md">Menu</a>

<!-- TIDAK AKTIF -->
<a class="hover:bg-purple-50 hover:text-[#6B21A8] text-gray-600 transition-all duration-300 rounded-xl py-3 px-4 font-bold">Menu</a>
```

