## 7. Relasi Model Eloquent

| Model | Metode | Tipe Relasi | Ke Model |
|---|---|---|---|
| `Mahasiswa` | `dosenWali()` | `belongsTo` | `Dosen` |
| `Dosen` | `mahasiswaWali()` | `hasMany` | `Mahasiswa` |
| `Dosen` | `bimbinganMagang()` | `hasMany` | `Magang` |
| `Magang` | `peserta()` | `hasMany` | `PesertaMagang` |
| `Magang` | `pembimbing()` | `belongsTo` | `Dosen` |
| `Magang` | `logbooks()` | `hasMany` | `Logbook` |
| `Magang` | `laporan()` | `hasOne` | `Laporan` |
| `PesertaMagang` | `mahasiswa()` | `belongsTo` | `Mahasiswa` |

> [!WARNING]
> Nama metode relasi di Model `Magang` adalah **`peserta()`** — bukan `pesertaMagang()`. Error `RelationNotFoundException` akan terjadi jika salah nama.

---

## 8. Alur Bisnis (Business Flow)

### Alur Mahasiswa

```
Register Akun
    → Login → Dashboard [status: Pending]
    → Isi form Pendaftaran Magang (pilih Dosen Wali)
    → Menunggu Dosen Wali APPROVE
    → [status: Approve] → Akun aktif, mulai magang
    → Isi Logbook Harian (dimonitor Dosen Pembimbing)
    → Unggah Laporan Akhir
    → Laporan di-review Dosen Pembimbing
    → [status_laporan: Approve] → SELESAI
```

### Alur Dosen Wali

```
Login → Dashboard
    → Menu "Rekomendasi Magang"
    → Melihat daftar Mahasiswa Wali [status: Pending]
    → Klik APPROVE
    → status_magang Mahasiswa = 'Approve'
```

### Alur Dosen Pembimbing

```
Login → Dashboard
    → Monitoring Mahasiswa (pantau semua bimbingan)
    → Review Logbook (baca & beri catatan)
    → Review Laporan Akhir (setujui / minta revisi)
```

---

## 9. Daftar Rute Lengkap

### Public

| Method | URL | Keterangan |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/login` | Halaman login |
| POST | `/login` | Proses login |
| GET | `/register` | Halaman register |
| POST | `/register` | Proses register |

### Mahasiswa (`auth` middleware)

| Method | URL | Handler |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/dashboard` | `MahasiswaController@dashboard` |
| GET/POST | `/mahasiswa/pendaftaran` | `MahasiswaController@pendaftaran/store` |
| GET | `/mahasiswa/progress` | `MahasiswaController@progress` |
| GET | `/mahasiswa/logbook` | view `mahasiswa.logbook` |
| GET | `/mahasiswa/laporan` | view `mahasiswa.laporan` |
| GET | `/mahasiswa/profile` | view `mahasiswa.profile` |
| GET | `/mahasiswa/settings` | view `mahasiswa.settings` |

### Dosen (`auth` middleware)

| Method | URL | Handler |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/dashboard/dosen` | `DosenController@dashboard` |
| GET | `/dosen/rekomendasi` | `DosenController@rekomendasi` |
| POST | `/dosen/rekomendasi/{mahasiswa}/approve` | `DosenController@rekomendasikan` |
| GET | `/dosen/monitoring` | `DosenController@monitoring` |
| GET | `/dosen/logbook` | `DosenController@logbook` |
| GET | `/dosen/laporan` | `DosenController@laporan` |

### Operator (`auth` middleware)

| Method | URL | View |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/dashboard/operator` | `operator.dashboard` |
| GET | `/operator/verifikasi` | `operator.verifikasi` |
| GET | `/operator/id-magang` | `operator.id_magang` |
| GET | `/operator/surat-pengantar` | `operator.surat_pengantar` |
| GET | `/operator/dosen-pembimbing` | `operator.dosen_pembimbing` |
| GET | `/operator/monitoring` | `operator.monitoring` |
| GET | `/operator/laporan` | `operator.laporan` |
| GET | `/operator/arsip` | `operator.arsip` |

